    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omu kubonekerwa kwange nshuba naga amaisho; kugya kugira nti mbona amagali ganai nigaruga ahagati y'amabanga gabili g'omulinga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egali eya mbere ekaba nekururwa efarasi zilikutukura. Eya kabili nekururwa ezilikwiragura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Eya kashatu nekururwa ezilikwera. Eya kanai nekururwa efarasi za runyai. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho mbaza omumalaika wonabaire ninfumora nawe nti, “Rugaba rwange, ebi biki?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omumalaika amporora ati, “Efarasi ezi nizija kuturuka kugya omu nsi zona, zaruga aha Mukama w'ensi yona. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Egali elikukururwa efarasi ezilikwiragura negya omu nsi ya bikara. Ezilikwera nizigya omu nsi y'obugyaizoba. Eza runyai nizigya omu nsi ya kasi.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Efarasi ezo kazaturukire zikaba nizilibalibwa kugenda kugya kurambura ensi. Omumalaika azigambira ati, “Iroko murambure ensi.” Kityo zigenda zirambura. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahanyuma angambira n'eiraka lihango ati, “Efarasi ezigire bikara, Babiloni, zichuleize ekiniga ky'Omukama omu nsi egyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aho Omukama angambira ati, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Omu bazahe abarugire Babiloni oihyemu Helidai, Tobiasi na Yedaya; kiro kyonene ekyo okwate omuhanda ogye omwa Yosia eya Zefania. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakuhe efeza n'ezahabu, ozikoze orukinga, orujweke Yoshua Omukuhani Nyamukuru, mutabani wa Yehozadaki aha mutwe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Omugambire oti, ‘Omukama w'amahe nagamba ati: Omuntu alikwetwa Itagi naija kuramuuka mbali ali mara ayombeke buhya Rwensinga y'Omukama. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Niwe aragyombeka. Kandi arakunirwa nk'omukama, abandare aha nketo, atware. Kandi aha nketoye harabaho Omukuhani, mara bombili nibaija kushobokeranganwa kurungi bagir'emilembe.’ ” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orukinga ruraikara Rwensinga, rube kaijukiro ka Helidai, Tobiasi, Yedaya, na Yosia eya Zefania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ZEC 6:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Abali harai baraija bajune kwombeka buhya Rwensinga y'Omukama. Orwo eramara kushubwamu muramanya okwo Omukama w'amahe niwe abantumireho. Ebi byona birabaho bityo kamuragira omuhuliro nyantayuga aha by'Omukama Ruhanga wanyu alikubaragira.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ZEC.6.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ZEC.6.15"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
